      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was a little surprised that this change was working so well as Metalava does not support passing multiple files for `--migrate-nullness`, `--api-lint` or the baseline options but I realized that it is working because Metalava just uses the last one and ignores the rest and the last file is the widest scope which is what was being passed before.",
