      "writtenOn": "2024-02-27T11:33:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this might be because Metalava filters out changes that are not in the `Codebase` being created, which for the case of `module-lib` would exclude any issues in the public or system APIs. However, with this change the `Codebase` being created for `module-lib` would include the `public` and `system`.\n\nThe issue has already been included in the `art-incompatibilities.txt` file for the `public` api (see https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:prebuilts/sdk/35/public/api/art-incompatibilities.txt;l\u003d39;drc\u003d9c99b8b09682eb4241f7cb3c89e8a9d156cd568e).\n\nI will fix Metalava to only report issues on APIs listed in the last (widest) file, otherwise we will end up duplicating every error in `public` in `system` and every error in `system` in `test` and `module-lib`. It will be a nightmare.",
